# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Vendored ArtPlayer Anich Edition — its `dist/` directory contains the
# precompiled bundle produced by the ArtPlayer repo's GitHub Actions.
# Without this exception, the global `dist` rule above would strip the
# vendored bundle from the repo and break `pnpm install` / `vite build`
# in CI clones of this repository.
!third_party/artplayer-anich/dist/
!third_party/artplayer-anich/dist/**

